                </div>
              </div>
            </td>

            <td class="whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
              Haircut and Styling
            </td>

            <td class="whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
              30 July 2026
            </td>

            <td class="whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">
              £45.00
            </td>

            <td class="whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-4">
